    "Description": "IBM Java SE version 8 includes the IBM Java Runtime Environment and the IBM Java Software Development Kit.\n\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\n* openjdk: Enhance MIDI file handling (Oracle CPU 2026-10) (CVE-2026-91400)\n\n* openjdk: Enhance TLS Extensions (Oracle CPU 2026-10) (CVE-2026-91461)\n\n* openjdk: Enhance Preferences (Oracle CPU 2026-10) (CVE-2026-91380)\n\n* openjdk: Improve ciphertext handling (Oracle CPU 2026-10) (CVE-2026-91333)\n\n* openjdk: Enhance SASL Authentication (Oracle CPU 2026-10) (CVE-2026-83381)\n\n* openjdk: Improve HTTP headers (Oracle CPU 2026-10) (CVE-2026-91453)\n\n* openjdk: Enhance Certificate Constraint Checking (Oracle CPU 2026-10) (CVE-2026-101516)\n\n* openjdk: Improve Pack200 handling (Oracle CPU 2026-10) (CVE-2026-91396)\n\n* openjdk: Enhance HTTP Client Response Handling (Oracle CPU 2026-10) (CVE-2026-83395)\n\n* openjdk: Enhance HTTP server parsing (Oracle CPU 2026-10) (CVE-2026-91451)\n\n* openjdk: Enhance WebRowSets (Oracle CPU 2026-10) (CVE-2026-83387)\n\n* openjdk: Enhance Font Rendering (Oracle CPU 2026-10) (CVE-2026-91381)\n\n* openjdk: Enhance HTTP server (Oracle CPU 2026-10) (CVE-2026-91452)\n\n* openjdk: Enhance krb5 tokens (Oracle CPU 2026-10) (CVE-2026-91462)\n\n* openjdk: Enhance Network Clients (Oracle CPU 2026-10) (CVE-2026-87292)\n\n* openjdk: Enhance TLS handshakes (Oracle CPU 2026-10) (CVE-2026-91373)\n\n* openjdk: Enhance Pack200 unpacking (Oracle CPU 2026-10) (CVE-2026-91395)\n\n* openjdk: Enhance zipfs (Oracle CPU 2026-10) (CVE-2026-91410)\n\n* openjdk: Enhance TLS certificate handling (Oracle CPU 2026-10) (CVE-2026-83376)\n\n* openjdk: Enhance font rendering (Oracle CPU 2026-10) (CVE-2026-91415)\n\n* openjdk: Enhance RMI connections (Oracle CPU 2026-10) (CVE-2026-87293)\n\n* openjdk: Enhance JPEG loading (Oracle CPU 2026-10) (CVE-2026-91334)\n\n* openjdk: Enhance Image Processing (Oracle CPU 2026-10) (CVE-2026-91382)\n\n* openjdk: Enhance GIF loading (Oracle CPU 2026-10) (CVE-2026-91418)\n\n* openjdk: Enhance XML Processing (Oracle CPU 2026-10) (CVE-2026-83400)\n\n* openjdk: Enhance Kerberos validation (Oracle CPU 2026-10) (CVE-2026-91464)\n\n* openjdk: Enhance SOCKS5 support (Oracle CPU 2026-10) (CVE-2026-91398)\n\n* openjdk: Enhance PKCS5 padding (Oracle CPU 2026-10) (CVE-2026-83374)\n\n* openjdk: Enhance krb5 client (Oracle CPU 2026-10) (CVE-2026-91463)\n\n* openjdk: Enhance Certificate Name Checks (Oracle CPU 2026-10) (CVE-2026-87294)\n\n* openjdk: Enhance CORBA (Oracle CPU 2026-10) (CVE-2026-91417)\n\n* OpenJDK: Distrust eMudhra intermediate CA certificates due to security concerns (CVE-2026-91403)\n\n* OpenJDK: Distrust eMudhra intermediate CA certificates due to security concerns (CVE-2026-114820)\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.",
